  "worked_solution": "The windsurfer is accelerating when their acceleration is positive. In a speed-time graph, the acceleration is given by the slope of the line. So, we need to find the times for which the slope is positive.\n\nWe see from the graph that the slope is positive from $t=0\\,\\text{s}$ to $t=3\\,\\text{s}$ and from $t=5\\,\\text{s}$ to $t=7\\,\\text{s}.$ Therefore, the motorcycle is windsurfer in this time interval.",
